OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally cloudy or foggy
OL,6,Fstart, with the fog locally dense,
OL,7,Fespecially for southern locations. The
OL,8,Ffog will slowly clear and brighter
OL,9,Fconditions gradually develop for many
OL,10,Fareas, although throughout the day
OL,11,Fpatchy light rain may each Derbyshire.
OL,12,FTemperatures near average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FLargely cloudy across
OL,15,Fnorthern parts, with a chance of
OL,16,Foccasional light rain. Dry elsewhere
OL,17,Fwith some clear spells, allowing
OL,18,Fpatchy fog to quickly form, this
OL,19,Fbecoming locally dense. Feeling chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
