OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloudy across northern areas
OL,6,Fwith occasional light rain or drizzle.
OL,7,FFurther south areas of fog will
OL,8,Fgradually clear, leaving bright or
OL,9,Fsunny spells. Later fog is likely to
OL,10,Freturn.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,13,Fdry Monday and Tuesday with variable
OL,14,Fcloud and sunny spells once any
OL,15,Fovernight fog clears. Wednesday cloudy
OL,16,Fwith outbreaks of rain. Temperatures
OL,17,Fnear average with generally light
OL,18,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
